   ("pin sb down", "make someone give exact details or a decision – a date", "buộc ai nói rõ, chốt – ngày giờ"),
   ("have it out with sb", "talk about something that made you angry to improve things (informal) – Joel and Finn", "nói thẳng cho ra lẽ (thân mật) – Joel và Finn"),
   ("wind sb up", "tell someone something untrue as a joke or to annoy them (informal)", "trêu, chọc tức (thân mật)"),
   ("mouth off", "talk as if you know more than everyone, or complain a lot (informal)", "ba hoa, kêu ca (thân mật)"),
